      "prompt": {
        "zh": "帮我调用 AlphaGBM 拆解一份已发布研报，说明机构观点、原始评级、关键假设、风险和后续验证节点。",
        "en": "Use AlphaGBM to break down a published report: institutional views, original ratings, key assumptions, risks and checkpoints."
